{
  "_comment": "SpellMob filters + minHealthPercent 测试包：5 个变体靠计分板标签区分，互不干扰；野生僵尸完全不受影响。",
  "variants": [
    {
      "_comment": "① 处刑者：只打血量 <= 35% 的目标（maxHealthPercent）。把测试目标打到 30% 血，它才会出手。",
      "select": {
        "tags": [
          "filter_execute"
        ]
      },
      "override": true,
      "goals": [
        {
          "spell": "irons_spellbooks:magic_missile",
          "level": 2,
          "cooldown": 80,
          "priority": 1,
          "range": 20.0,
          "target": {
            "type": "NEAREST_HOSTILE",
            "filters": {
              "maxHealthPercent": 0.35,
              "ignoreCreative": true
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_comment": "② 骑士：不打血量 < 50% 的目标（minHealthPercent），用来验证“别打死残血”。满血时正常开火。",
      "select": {
        "tags": [
          "filter_knight"
        ]
      },
      "override": true,
      "goals": [
        {
          "spell": "irons_spellbooks:fireball",
          "level": 1,
          "cooldown": 100,
          "priority": 1,
          "range": 20.0,
          "target": {
            "type": "NEAREST_HOSTILE",
            "filters": {
              "minHealthPercent": 0.5,
              "ignoreCreative": true
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_comment": "③ 刺客：只打没举盾的玩家（requireNoShield）。举盾靠近它，它不应施法；放下盾，它立刻开火。",
      "select": {
        "tags": [
          "filter_assassin"
        ]
      },
      "override": true,
      "goals": [
        {
          "spell": "irons_spellbooks:slow",
          "level": 2,
          "cooldown": 60,
          "priority": 1,
          "range": 16.0,
          "target": {
            "type": "NEAREST_PLAYER",
            "filters": {
              "requireNoShield": true,
              "ignoreCreative": true
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_comment": "④ 独行侠：不与同队成员交手（excludeCasterTeam）。把它和你加进同一个队伍后，它就不打你。",
      "select": {
        "tags": [
          "filter_loner"
        ]
      },
      "override": true,
      "goals": [
        {
          "spell": "irons_spellbooks:magic_missile",
          "level": 1,
          "cooldown": 80,
          "priority": 1,
          "range": 18.0,
          "target": {
            "type": "NEAREST_HOSTILE",
            "filters": {
              "excludeCasterTeam": true
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_comment": "⑤ 猎手：只打袭击者（entityTags），并忽略带 spellmob_immune 标签的目标（excludeTags）。召唤一只劫掠者测试。",
      "select": {
        "tags": [
          "filter_hunter"
        ]
      },
      "override": true,
      "goals": [
        {
          "spell": "irons_spellbooks:slow",
          "level": 1,
          "cooldown": 60,
          "priority": 1,
          "range": 18.0,
          "target": {
            "type": "NEAREST_HOSTILE",
            "filters": {
              "entityTags": [
                "minecraft:raiders"
              ],
              "excludeTags": [
                "spellmob_immune"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
